| --- | --- |
| UI becomes a second source of truth | Frontend only consumes typed API and action preview/execute endpoints. |
| Markdown XSS | Backend sanitization and explicit sanitizer tests. |
| Approving stale MR head | Required `expected_head_sha` on approve/merge/rebase. |
| Adapter feature mismatch | Capability flags and disabled controls with clear reasons. |
| Large repo performance | Virtualized file trees, pagination, blob size limits, query prefetch. |
| WebSocket missed events | Cursor replay and polling/SSE fallback. |
| Settings confusion | Searchable schema, preview diff, audit history, reset-to-default. |
| Scope explosion | Phase gates; repo overview/code/MR/settings first. |

