# JeRyu Full Git Web Diff Blueprint

This document is the file-by-file engineering diff inventory for turning JeRyu into a Rust + Vite + TypeScript + React web platform with GitHub/GitLab-class repository, review, merge, settings, README rendering, and realtime WebSocket workflows.

This is a blueprint for implementation PRs. It is not an already-applied patch.

---

## Legend

- `A` = add file
- `M` = modify file
- `R` = replace file contents or purpose
- `G` = generated file

---

## 1. Root Build and Workspace

| Status | Path | Change |
|---|---|---|
| `M` | `Cargo.toml` | Enable Axum WebSocket/multipart/macros features; add web, markdown, OpenAPI, session, sanitizer, and TypeScript export dependencies. |
| `M` | `Cargo.lock` | Lock dependency graph after adding web stack. |
| `M` | `README.md` | Add JeRyu Web section and commands. |
| `M` | `.github/workflows/rust.yml` or existing CI | Add `cargo check --features web`, frontend install/build/test, generated types freshness check. |
| `M` | `proof-lanes.toml` | Add `web-ui`, `web-api`, `markdown-rendering`, `websocket-realtime`, and `review-merge` proof lanes. |

Recommended `Cargo.toml` additions:

```toml
axum = { version = "0.8", features = ["json", "ws", "macros", "multipart"] }
tower-http = { version = "0.6", features = ["cors", "trace", "fs", "compression-gzip", "set-header"] }
headers = "0.4"
http = "1"
http-body-util = "0.1"
mime_guess = "2"
bytes = "1"
tokio-stream = { version = "0.1", features = ["sync"] }
async-stream = "0.3"
comrak = "0.35"
ammonia = "4"
syntect = { version = "5", default-features = false, features = ["html", "parsing", "dump-load"] }
ts-rs = { version = "11", features = ["chrono-impl", "uuid-impl"] }
utoipa = { version = "5", features = ["axum_extras", "chrono", "uuid"] }
argon2 = "0.5"
cookie = "0.18"
time = { version = "0.3", features = ["serde"] }
jsonwebtoken = "9"
constant_time_eq = "0.3"
url = "2"
```

